# AI Agent Workflow (Core)

Follow this order for every feature or screen.

## Checklist

1. Read `PROJECT_GOALS.md` and `MEMORY_BANK.md`
2. Review requested feature and Stitch design (if provided)
3. **Domain/Data missing?** Create UseCase + Repository per Clean Architecture; set `UseCaseState` returns and Koin bindings
4. **UI:** Design `[Feature]Contract.kt` (State, Intent, Effect), write ViewModel; register in Koin
5. **Compose:** Build screen — Stitch/theme fidelity, `LocalStrings`, no hardcoded text. Welcome, onboarding steps, generation, and paywall share the onboarding design language in `ui-design-system-core`
6. Add `Route` and `entry<...>` in `NavigationRoot.kt`
7. **Build** after each logical step (`./gradlew :composeApp:assembleDebug`); fix errors before continuing
8. When done and tests pass, append summary to `MEMORY_BANK.md`

## Layer Rules (file-scoped)

| Topic | Rule file |
|-------|-----------|
| Modules | `architecture-modular-core` |
| UseCase / ViewModel | `usecase-viewmodel-core` |
| Ktor / Repository | `data-network-core` |
| MVI | `mvi-presentation-core` |
| UI / Stitch | `ui-design-system-core` |
| Strings | `localization-core` |
| Route / Koin | `navigation-koin-core` |
